I always forget, but if you try applying the holder first and it
doesn't work, nothing wasted.  (That I remember the sequence this way
might say something about how often I've had to rely on it.)

> Next find the square.
> Then find Rodney and take the book.
> Go back to the square, ring the bell, apply the candle holder, read the
> book.
> Find the high priest and take the amulet.
> Run like crazy up to lvl1
> I'll worry about what is above lvl1 later.

You want to make sure to at least map out the way between the
staircases on each level of Genhennom, and use that pick-axe of yours
to dig out a quick path along the way.  Wands of digging can also help,
but you won't get much digging down with each charge and you might want
to make sure you have some spare for the after-lvl-1 stuff.

